      "writtenOn": "2018-05-08T00:30:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Have you considered restricting this change to this specific case? That might make it feel less hacky. The position of this patch could then be \"this patch allows updating the mark if it is not set. it could be generalized to support updating any mark to a stricter subset for itself, but that seems like it could be confusing to userspace, since some updates will possible and others will not\".",
